==Icelandic==

===Etymology===
From {{m|is|skemmta||to entertain}} and {{m|is|sér}} the dative of {{m|is|sig||oneself}}.

===Verb===
'''[[skemmta]] [[sig#Icelandic|sér]]'''

# to [[enjoy oneself]], to [[have fun]], (''UK'') to [[have a laugh]]{{jump|is|enjoy oneself|s}}
#: ''Heyrðu.. Reyndu allavegana að '''skemmta þér''', okei?''
#:: Listen.. At least try to '''have fun''', OK?

====Derived terms====
* {{l|is|skemmta sér konunglega}}

